  "description": "Bernadette is a shy, ordinary girl from a provincial town. But when the Blessed Virgin Mary appears to her one day, her entire life turns upside-down. Suddenly Bernadette must face fame, ridicule, and the suspicions of authorities who will do anything to keep her quiet. Yet in all this turmoil, a deeper question haunts her heart: what does God really want of her?\nSource: Pauline Books & Media",
